amdgpu.target<gfx942> @target

low.func.def target<amdgpu.cdna3.core>(@target) @adjacent_gfx942(%a: reg<amdgpu.vgpr>, %b: reg<amdgpu.vgpr>, %increment: reg<amdgpu.sgpr>) -> (reg<amdgpu.sgpr>) asm {
